75、Windows 11 24H2 升级至 10.0.26100.2894、Windows Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.2894。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制物理访问权限，因为该漏洞需要攻击者具备物理接触设备的能力（AV:P）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2025/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21228","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21228.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21228"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0687.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0686","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0686.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21227","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字媒体特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞，该漏洞源于 Windows Digital Media 在处理特定媒体文件时未正确验证内存边界，导致越界读取。具有低权限的本地攻击者可通过物理访问目标系统，利用特制的媒体文件触发该漏洞，成功利用后可提升至 SYSTEM 权限，实现机密性、完整性和可用性的完全破坏。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 版本，CVSS 评分 6.6，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21227"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:49Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，该更新已修复 Windows Digital Media 的权限提升漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议将受影响的 Windows Media 组件运行在最低权限用户账户下，并限制非管理员用户对数字媒体组件的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21227","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2025/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21227","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21227.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21227"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0686.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0685","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0685.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21226","title":"Microsoft Windows Digital Media 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 数字媒体组件存在越界读取漏洞，具有物理访问权限的低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞读取系统内存中的敏感信息，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞源于 Windows Digital Media 组件在处理特定媒体文件时未正确验证内存边界，导致越界读取。攻击者需具备物理访问目标系统的能力，CVSS 评分 6.6，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21226"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:49Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制受影响的 Windows Digital Media 组件的用户权限，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21226","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2025/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21226","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21226.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21226"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0685.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0684","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0684.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21225","title":"Microsoft Windows Remote Desktop Gateway（RD 网关）拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面网关（RD Gateway）存在类型混淆（Type Confusion）漏洞，攻击复杂度较高，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 RD Gateway 服务发送特制网络请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统服务崩溃并拒绝服务。该漏洞影响启用远程桌面网关功能的 Windows Server 及桌面版本，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5049983）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21225"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:49Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows Server 2022 安装 KB5049983，Windows Server 2025 安装 KB5050009，Windows Server 23H2 安装 KB5049984。可通过 Windows Update 自动更新或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 下载独立包。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制对 RD Gateway 端口（默认 443/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信任源 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21225","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/34eb3a7695e83b6a33083dbe114e8beca526a149/2025/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21225.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/mitre/CVE-2025-21225"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0684.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0683","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0683.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21224","title":"Microsoft Windows 行式打印机守护程序 (LPD) 服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Line Printer Daemon (LPD) 服务存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，攻击复杂度较高但无需身份认证，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统的 LPD 服务发送特制数据包触发内存释放后重用，成功利用可在目标系统上实现远程代码执行，获取完整机密性、完整性和可用性控制。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21224"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:49Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049981)，该更新修复了 Windows LPD 服务中的释放后使用 (Use-After-Free) 远程代码执行漏洞。受影响版本包括 Windows 10 21H2/22H2、Windows 11 22H2/23H2/24H2、Windows Server 2022/2025，各版本对应修复版本号详见 MSRC 公告。如无法立即打补丁，可在服务管理器中停止并禁用 \"Print Spooler\" 服务，或在防火墙中阻止对 515/TCP 端口的入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21224","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21224-remote-code-execution-vulnerability-in-windows-line-printer-daemon-service-detection-script","https://www.vicarius.io/vsociety/posts/cve-2025-21224-remote-code-execution-vulnerability-in-windows-line-printer-daemon-service-mitigation-script","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2025/CVE-2025-21224.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2025/CVE-2025-21224.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21224.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2025/CVE-2025-21224.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0682","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0682.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21223","title":"Microsoft Windows 电话服务远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 电话服务（Telephony Service）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），由于服务在处理特定远程过程调用（RPC）请求时未正确验证输入数据长度，导致堆内存越界写入。远程攻击者可通过诱导目标用户连接到恶意 RPC 服务器或访问特制网络资源触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上以电话服务权限执行任意代码，实现完全控制受影响的系统。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，包括 Windows 10、Windows 11 及 Windows Server 系列，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21223"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:49Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5049984) 以修复 Windows Telephony Service 中的堆溢出漏洞。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。对于无法立即打补丁的系统，建议限制 TAPI 服务对不可信网络的暴露，并在防火墙层面阻止未经授权的 RPC 流量到达电话服务组件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2025/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21223","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21223.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21223"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0682.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0679","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0679.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21220","title":"Microsoft 消息队列信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft 消息队列（MSMQ）组件存在信息泄露漏洞，由于对未初始化资源（CWE-908）的不当处理，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络向目标系统的 MSMQ 服务发送特制请求，触发未初始化内存读取，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050061）中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21220"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft 更新目录手动下载。受影响版本包括 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多版本，更新后对应版本号分别为：Win10 1507≥10.0.10240.20890、Win10 1809≥10.0.17763.6775、Win11 24H2≥10.0.26100.2894、Server 2022≥10.0.20348.3091 等。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络层面限制对 MSMQ 服务（TCP 端口 1801）的匿名网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21220","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2025/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21220","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21220.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21220"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0679.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0678","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0678.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21219","title":"Microsoft Windows MapUrlToZone 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Windows MapUrlToZone 功能存在安全功能绕过漏洞（CWE-41），该函数用于将 URL 映射到对应的安全区域（Internet/Intranet/受信任站点等）。攻击者可构造特制 URL 或文件，诱导用户点击后绕过安全区域限制，使本应归入低信任 Internet 区域的内容被错误地视为高信任区域来源，导致攻击者能够读取本不应被访问的受限信息。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需认证，但需要用户交互，影响 Windows 多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21219"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新：Windows 10 21H2/22H2 安装 KB5049981（OS Build 19044.5371 / 19045.5371），Windows 11 22H2/23H2 安装 KB5050008（OS Build 22621.4751 / 22631.4751），Windows 11 24H2 安装 KB5050009（OS Build 26100.2894），Windows Server 2019 安装 KB5050008（OS Build 17763.6775），Windows Server 2022 安装 KB5049983（OS Build 20348.3091）。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft 更新目录网站手动下载。该漏洞需要用户交互（点击恶意链接），建议同时教育用户不要点击来源不明的 URL。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2025/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21219.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21219","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21219.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0678.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0677","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0677.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21218","title":"Microsoft Windows Kerberos 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows Kerberos 存在拒绝服务漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统的 Kerberos 服务发送特制请求，触发资源消耗（CWE-400），导致服务不可用。该漏洞影响多个 Windows 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21218"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新（KB5050004），通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取。受影响版本包括 Windows Server 2012/2012 R2/2016/2019/2022/2025，更新后各版本对应内核版本号分别为 6.2.9200.25273、6.3.9600.22371、10.0.14393.7699、10.0.17763.6775、10.0.20348.3091、10.0.26100.2894。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙或网络层面限制对 Kerberos 服务（TCP/UDP 88）的未授权网络访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21218","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-212xx/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2025/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2025/CVE-2025-21218.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21218"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0677.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0676","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0676.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21217","title":"Microsoft Windows NTLM 欺骗漏洞","description":"Windows NTLM 存在欺骗漏洞，由于 NTLM 身份认证协议中的保护机制失效，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问恶意服务器或打开特制文件，触发 NTLM 凭据泄露。成功利用该漏洞可导致攻击者获取目标用户的 NTLM 哈希值，进而用于离线破解或中继攻击。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，CVSS 评分 6.5，需用户交互方可利用。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21217"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:33Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:48Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)，可通过 Windows Update 自动获取或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载。受影响系统包括：Windows 10 1507 需升级至 10.0.10240.20890 及以上、Windows 10 1607 需升级至 10.0.14393.7699 及以上、Windows 10 1809 需升级至 10.0.17763.6775 及以上、Windows 10 21H2/22H2 需升级至 10.0.19044.5371/10.0.19045.5371 及以上、Windows 11 22H2/23H2/24H2 需分别升级至 10.0.22621.4751/10.0.22631.4751/10.0.26100.2894 及以上、Windows Server 2016/2019/2022/2025 需升级至对应修复版本。如无法立即打补丁，可限制不受信任来源对 NTLM 服务的访问，并教育用户不要点击可疑链接或打开不可信文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21217","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e8a327b5fb8f10386ada774358fd16a706ab4c88/2025/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21217","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21217.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21217"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0676.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0674","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0674.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-21215","title":"Microsoft Windows Secure Boot 安全功能绕过漏洞","description":"Microsoft Windows 安全启动（Secure Boot）功能存在安全功能绕过漏洞（CWE-125 越界读取）。由于 Secure Boot 组件在处理启动策略时存在越界读取缺陷，具有物理访问权限的攻击者可在系统启动过程中绕过 Secure Boot 安全验证机制，从而读取受保护内存中的敏感信息，导致机密性泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，但需要攻击者能够物理接触目标设备。影响范围涵盖 Windows 10/11 多个版本及 Windows Server 2008 至 2025 系列。Microsoft 已在 2025 年 1 月安全更新中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2025-21215"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-01-14T18:15:32Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:42:47Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2025 年 1 月安全更新 (KB5050061)。各受影响版本对应的修复版本号：Windows 10 1507 升级至 10.0.10240.20890，Windows 10 1607/Server 2016 升级至 10.0.14393.7699，Windows 10 1809/Server 2019 升级至 10.0.17763.6775，Windows 10 21H2 升级至 10.0.19044.5371，Windows 10 22H2 升级至 10.0.19045.5371，Windows 11 22H2 升级至 10.0.22621.4751，Windows 11 23H2 升级至 10.0.22631.4751，Windows 11 24H2/Server 2025 升级至 10.0.26100.2894，Server 2022 升级至 10.0.20348.3091，Server 2022 23H2 升级至 10.0.25398.1369。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议在 UEFI 固件设置中启用 Secure Boot 并确保 DBX 证书吊销列表为最新版本，同时限制物理接触系统的人员权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2025-21215","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e615d840f21a506ab4861678584a0f621d55a0d3/2025/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2025-21215","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2025/21xxx/CVE-2025-21215.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-21215"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.c